  "type": "multipleCorrect",
  "level": 2,
  "question": {
    "text": "Consider the parabola <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></math>. Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi></math> be the focus of the parabola. A pair of tangents drawn to the parabola from the point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;meet the parabola at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>. Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;be points on the lines <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;respectively such that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;is perpendicular to&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;is perpendicular to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>. Then, which of the following is/are TRUE?",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "PdBqE",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "8Jco8",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>10</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>5</mn></mfrac></math>",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "syO5X",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math>",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "frWeb",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>",
      "isCorrect": true,
